{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake up on a decayed island\u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no memory of who you are, you begin to explore the island's memories to uncover the truth about yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you find are the tragedies that struck the boys and girls and the mysterious phenomena surrounding this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reason you're here, your true identity, and the island's future\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is you who will decide them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/extras/a9eef400aadcabeadd255ce4d6e8161f.avif?t=1773374646\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is divided into two parts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the <strong>Puzzle Part</strong>, where you collect Memory Cores,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the <strong>Novel Part</strong>, where you relive the island's events through the memories stored within those cores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thrilling puzzle action with chain reactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit blocks with bullets of the same color. If three or more connect, they explode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the path, set off a chain reaction to reach the main core at the deepest point, and grab it to clear the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the number of bullets is limited, plan your moves so the explosions chain efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/extras/89559b2fd3f4f6a5ea30c5866983060a.poster.avif?t=1773374646\" width=330 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/extras/89559b2fd3f4f6a5ea30c5866983060a.webm?t=1773374646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/extras/89559b2fd3f4f6a5ea30c5866983060a.mp4?t=1773374646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who aren\u2019t great at puzzles\u2014or who simply want to see what happens next\u2014don\u2019t worry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the <strong><i>&quot;Trigger Happy&quot;</i> Mode</strong>, you can clear stages by blasting through the blocks with bullets that always explode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel the island's story through Memory Cores</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offer the collected cores to the Great Tree to witness the memories of the people involved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps items found in the Puzzle Part may awaken hidden memories...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/extras/1c3ce2b72c54d1470dae19709f218580.avif?t=1773374646\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Memories Flood In","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3759130/602d4f093076dc33b0e11bc581ef8b1136c254a1.jpg"},{"name":"Collapse of the Everyday","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3759130/4e77dcec6c6e954201d58145985d2fd49a066870.jpg"},{"name":"Pandemic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3759130/9d51421fb4c3037d97d4adac408db38288c533f6.jpg"},{"name":"Ways to Resist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3759130/fa052a9519badb2e1533e6f950b15ff164960ddb.jpg"},{"name":"Pioneer of Memories","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3759130/c4f66ba75c5b06e116817f0be3fcfd901e080142.jpg"},{"name":"One Hundred Million Friends?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3759130/770c73ad37db882285440344821199d23b65b170.jpg"},{"name":"The Last Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3759130/8d0d9be00ef811dd14386648e68aace488744c9f.jpg"},{"name":"Entrusted Feelings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3759130/40a38bad7ac773e8be370ca53e90d959ee820d53.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Breaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3759130/e514b529d7c07f47b3d81432f080eb0a528f3221.jpg"},{"name":"A Story That Leads to Today","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3759130/6df6f48ef9927087658907e46497238a7422129f.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759130?t=1773374646","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/c49d7f151e86581a9f839fc7f3255bbdfd20e33e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773374646","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/bdcfd9338edbc19461fa897ebe1b7479cb40e635/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773374646","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759130/bdcfd9338edbc19461fa897ebe1b7479cb40e635/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773374646","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},