 cores hidden across the island and uncover the truth behind a tragedy of the past. When the horrors that befell the boys and girls and the island\u2019s strange phenomena are revealed, what final choice will you make?","steam_appid":3759130,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://studio.cretia.net/contact/"},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese","type":"game","website":"https://studio.cretia.net/product/garakuta"}